1
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,400
Soy Cristian Calle.

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,000
Organizo eventos y pongo
música en vinilo

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,400
en Santa Elena, Medellín.

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:16,400
Y eso lo llevo a todo:

5
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,200
a la música, al lugar,
a la comida,

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,800
